 "remarks": "Lovingly cared for by the same family for 30+ years, this well-maintained 4-bed, 2-bath Cape is ideally located in the desirable Glenville School District. The main level offers a welcoming living room with fireplace, dining room, kitchen, 2 beds and one full bath, with 2 additional bedrooms and full bath upstairs. The walk-out lower level provides flexible space for a home office, family room or gym, plus laundry and direct access to a beautiful, private backyard--ideal for relaxing or entertaining. With approximately 2,300 sq. ft. of remaining FAR, there is exceptional potential to expand and customize. A rare opportunity to make this cherished home your own. Situated in a wonderful neighborhood, this home enjoys a prime Greenwich location close to shopping, parks, transportation and just minutes to Westchester.",
